Backport of src/device_info.rs only from glomatico/wrapper-v2 PR #24
(head 6918066e51926427c133230ececae6154d4d70dd), onto exact tag 1.0.0.
Fresh logins failed with authentication_failed/native_response and no 2FA
prompt (upstream issue #23). New identities use the reported client tuple and
a 64-bit Android ID; existing identities and explicit overrides are untouched.
Blob 7936fb7 is tag 1.0.0, b9d09b7 is the PR head file. Unlicense upstream.

